"Enable this feature if you want to insert a captcha form on the login page"
msgstr "如果您想在登录页面插入验证码表单，请启用此功能"

#: pages/page-visitorlog-guide.php:879
#: secu/secu-visitorlog-security-adminpanel.php:605
